WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.030
Episode 5

01:38.050 --> 01:39.630
All your files back then

01:39.650 --> 01:42.000
were transferred by the Investigator's Office.

01:44.650 --> 01:46.320
The only thing left

01:53.330 --> 01:56.090
is this arrest warrant.

01:59.010 --> 02:00.430
According to it,

02:00.450 --> 02:02.160
the crime you committed back then

02:02.180 --> 02:04.530
was assassinating court officials.

02:06.690 --> 02:08.400
This is weird.

02:08.570 --> 02:09.980
Why would the Investigator's Office

02:09.980 --> 02:11.550
hire a criminal

02:11.570 --> 02:13.200
like you?

02:13.340 --> 02:15.610
And why do you turn to me?

02:16.900 --> 02:18.330
To pick up your former career?

02:26.370 --> 02:28.240
Do you have the token for
Director-General of the Investigator's Office?

02:28.260 --> 02:29.320
Yes, I have.

02:29.340 --> 02:30.430
You will go to the Investigator's Office.

02:30.450 --> 02:31.760
Maybe!

02:38.980 --> 02:39.990
What are you doing?

02:40.010 --> 02:41.010
The Investigator's Office has special records

02:41.010 --> 02:42.400
of all cases.

02:42.540 --> 02:43.420
If you can bring me

02:43.420 --> 02:45.370
my file which doesn't have much importance,

02:46.420 --> 02:47.850
I'd give my life

02:47.850 --> 02:49.000
to you.

02:49.780 --> 02:51.200
And from now on,

02:52.010 --> 02:54.090
I'll be your slave and servant.

02:54.260 --> 02:58.040
You can determine my life and death.

03:04.850 --> 03:06.250
I don't want to do that.

03:10.140 --> 03:12.330
I will never

03:12.540 --> 03:13.340
kneel in front of you

03:13.340 --> 03:14.600
if I have another choice.

03:14.620 --> 03:15.890
I understand.

03:16.900 --> 03:17.450
I don't even have

03:17.450 --> 03:18.490
the slightest bit of dignity

03:18.490 --> 03:19.690
as a man.

03:20.180 --> 03:21.890
Don't push me.

03:23.140 --> 03:23.820
I might do

03:23.820 --> 03:25.190
terrible things beyond your imagination.

03:25.210 --> 03:26.970
I know you will.

03:29.930 --> 03:31.250
I swear

03:32.210 --> 03:33.710
that file is nothing confidential.

03:33.730 --> 03:34.880
Since you're the Director-General,

03:34.900 --> 03:36.070
it's a piece of cake for you to take it out

03:36.090 --> 03:37.370
without any trouble.

03:47.700 --> 03:49.480
I'm saying it once again.

03:50.780 --> 03:55.480
I don't want to do it.

04:12.370 --> 04:14.040
I will help you

04:14.290 --> 04:16.170
with one extra condition.

04:23.050 --> 04:24.320
You must tell me

04:24.540 --> 04:26.370
what's on the file,

04:27.580 --> 04:28.810
why you would

04:29.140 --> 04:30.140
assassinate the officials

04:30.140 --> 04:31.850
from the imperial court,

04:32.890 --> 04:34.250
and why

04:34.980 --> 04:38.290
do you give up everything?

04:43.460 --> 04:44.880
I was...

04:45.540 --> 04:47.250
These people are...

04:47.700 --> 04:49.290
The story was a cliche!

04:49.580 --> 04:51.800
This common couple poured water on the street

04:51.820 --> 04:53.480
and stained the royalty's dresses.

04:53.700 --> 04:55.640
As a consequence, they got beaten up.

05:03.090 --> 05:06.680
Thank you for saving my life.

05:06.700 --> 05:07.960
Thank you!

05:07.980 --> 05:10.090
Thank you for saving my life.

05:13.300 --> 05:15.020
So you stopped them

05:15.020 --> 05:15.930
protecting the couple?

05:15.930 --> 05:17.590
It's not their fault.

05:17.610 --> 05:19.310
I had no sense of propriety

05:19.330 --> 05:20.690
and stewed in my own juice.

05:20.980 --> 05:23.200
I don't think you did anything wrong.

05:27.140 --> 05:29.010
The master of those people

05:29.930 --> 05:31.720
is called Guo Baokun.

05:32.170 --> 05:33.640
And his father is Guo Youzhi,

05:34.170 --> 05:34.980
the current Minister

05:34.980 --> 05:36.840
of the Board of Rites.

05:36.860 --> 05:38.250
He has paramount power.

05:38.700 --> 05:39.870
What happened next?

05:39.890 --> 05:41.250
One day later,

05:41.460 --> 05:43.280
I was on the wanted list of the Ministry of Penalty.

05:43.300 --> 05:44.840
It's nothing but a fight.

05:44.860 --> 05:46.170
Why put you on the list?

05:46.170 --> 05:48.480
The charge was assassinating important officials.

05:53.580 --> 05:54.910
That charge

05:54.930 --> 05:56.810
was based on nothing.

06:00.650 --> 06:02.870
How did they declare you guilty without evidence?

06:02.890 --> 06:04.320
There were witnesses.

06:05.090 --> 06:06.410
The Guos?

06:06.540 --> 06:08.250
It was that couple.

06:23.860 --> 06:25.400
I was just convicted like that

06:25.420 --> 06:27.290
with extermination of all my family members.

06:27.770 --> 06:29.410
Your family got involved as well?

06:29.980 --> 06:32.250
My wife just got pregnant at the time.

06:34.020 --> 06:35.530
I begged them for mercy

06:37.740 --> 06:39.690
and asked for death

06:40.050 --> 06:41.750
in exchange for the lives of my family.

06:41.770 --> 06:43.070
But they told me that

06:43.090 --> 06:45.690
the national law is too rigorous
to give personal considerations.

06:55.740 --> 06:56.490
I remember that I wanted to laugh

06:56.490 --> 06:58.370
upon hearing these words,

06:59.890 --> 07:03.970
but I just couldn't.

07:08.650 --> 07:10.000
Who saved you?

07:10.020 --> 07:11.410
The Investigator's Office.

07:12.980 --> 07:15.200
They transferred me away from the jail

07:16.210 --> 07:18.000
and took away all the files

07:18.020 --> 07:19.400
with just one condition.

07:19.420 --> 07:20.210
They wanted me

07:20.210 --> 07:21.750
to serve them in the Investigator's Office.

07:21.770 --> 07:22.420
If I agree,

07:22.420 --> 07:24.350
they would save my family.

07:24.370 --> 07:26.410
They must be attracted by your capabilities.

07:27.650 --> 07:29.520
What if I don't know any Kung Fu?

07:29.540 --> 07:30.300
Will there be vegetation

07:30.300 --> 07:32.290
all over my cemetery?

07:39.420 --> 07:40.720
For sure,

07:42.820 --> 07:44.440
I am still alive,

07:45.980 --> 07:47.370
but a lot of people died

07:49.770 --> 07:52.010
with grudges.

07:56.890 --> 07:58.320
You hate them.

07:58.770 --> 07:59.970
Whom?

08:00.930 --> 08:02.480
Do you mean Guo Baokun?

08:03.210 --> 08:04.420
He is the son of the Minister of the Board of Rites

08:04.420 --> 08:05.170
who is at a top position.

08:05.170 --> 08:07.280
It's a bliss for me to stay alive.

08:07.300 --> 08:09.160
I don't dare to hate him.

08:09.650 --> 08:11.010
I mean that couple

08:11.170 --> 08:12.680
After I came under the Investigator's Office,

08:12.700 --> 08:14.600
I talked to them in private.

08:15.460 --> 08:16.490
I really want to give them

08:16.490 --> 08:17.760
a good round of beating

08:18.770 --> 08:20.970
to unleash the anger in my heart.

08:21.740 --> 08:23.040
Did you do it?

08:24.740 --> 08:26.320
Please give me some money.

08:27.580 --> 08:28.870
Please help me with some food.

08:28.890 --> 08:30.050
It's very tiring, isn't it?

08:30.050 --> 08:31.810
You're sweating.

08:32.460 --> 08:34.350
Miss, please give me some food.

08:34.370 --> 08:35.270
Miss!

08:35.290 --> 08:36.170
What a miserable boy!

08:36.170 --> 08:37.830
Please give me some food! Sir!

08:37.850 --> 08:39.520
Please give me some money! Sir!

08:39.700 --> 08:41.370
Give some to him.

08:43.780 --> 08:44.900
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

08:44.900 --> 08:46.040
Not at all.

08:46.490 --> 08:47.800
Let's go!

08:47.820 --> 08:49.890
Thank you! Thank you!

08:51.370 --> 08:52.510
Life is not easy for anyone.

08:52.530 --> 08:53.720
Yeah!

08:55.610 --> 08:57.520
Please give me some money. Sir!

08:58.460 --> 09:00.130
Please give me some food.

09:00.930 --> 09:02.800
Please have mercy! Sir!

09:02.820 --> 09:03.340
Please!

09:03.340 --> 09:05.210
Please give me some money! Sir!

09:06.530 --> 09:08.400
Please give me some food!

09:10.660 --> 09:12.250
Have mercy on me please!

09:12.660 --> 09:14.720
Please give me some food. Miss.

09:14.850 --> 09:16.320
Have mercy please!

09:16.340 --> 09:17.890
Anyone please help me?

09:17.930 --> 09:19.290
Thank you! Thank you! Sir!

09:19.290 --> 09:20.030
Thank you!

09:20.050 --> 09:21.280
Thank you!

09:22.660 --> 09:24.840
They are merely common people.

09:25.580 --> 09:28.370
What can they do when they are summoned by

09:30.580 --> 09:32.450
the Minister's Residence as witnesses?

09:34.610 --> 09:37.770
Ever since then,

09:40.140 --> 09:41.690
I understand that there is no black and white in this world

09:42.930 --> 09:45.920
but just rich and poor.

09:48.140 --> 09:49.840
I realized

09:50.220 --> 09:51.590
I had to take my wife and children away

09:51.610 --> 09:52.760
from the capital city

09:52.780 --> 09:53.490
and spent the rest of the life

09:53.490 --> 09:55.120
in obscurity.

09:55.140 --> 09:58.480
So you used me for a fake death

09:58.780 --> 10:00.400
to run away from the Investigator's Office?

10:02.340 --> 10:03.690
I went home once.

10:04.220 --> 10:05.680
It's all empty now.

10:05.700 --> 10:07.280
My family are all missing.

10:07.490 --> 10:08.050
I am a dead man

10:08.050 --> 10:08.850
in name.

10:08.850 --> 10:10.320
I can't investigate it.

10:10.340 --> 10:11.890
You're the only man

10:13.580 --> 10:15.330
that I can trust.

10:38.780 --> 10:40.160
So,

10:40.700 --> 10:42.030
this is the reason why you are looking for

10:42.050 --> 10:44.840
the files of the Investigator's Office?

11:02.220 --> 11:03.890
There must be record

11:04.410 --> 11:06.370
about my family's whereabouts.

11:06.820 --> 11:08.890
You have my life

11:09.050 --> 11:10.890
if you can help me find them.

11:11.050 --> 11:12.480
I don't need your life,

11:13.530 --> 11:15.130
but I'll help you.

11:17.930 --> 11:19.370
You clearly had the chance to kill that couple,

11:19.780 --> 11:21.960
but you didn't.

11:23.610 --> 11:25.570
You said you are apathetic now

11:26.490 --> 11:28.160
but you're not.

11:28.820 --> 11:32.210
That's the reason that I help you.

12:17.050 --> 12:18.130
Let's go!

12:44.730 --> 12:47.570
My Lady, it's time to take the medicine.

13:11.610 --> 13:12.520
Wan'er,

13:12.520 --> 13:12.610
Wan'er,
=Ye Ling'er, Lin Wan'er's good friend=

13:12.610 --> 13:14.080
I'm treating you with drumsticks today.
=Ye Ling'er, Lin Wan'er's good friend=

13:14.080 --> 13:15.160
I'm treating you with drumsticks today.

13:15.370 --> 13:16.880
My Lady! My Lady!

13:16.900 --> 13:18.370
Watch out for the wind!

13:19.660 --> 13:21.040
My Lady!

13:29.260 --> 13:30.140
You promised me

13:30.140 --> 13:31.470
to keep it a secret, didn't you?

13:31.490 --> 13:32.260
Why do you want everybody

13:32.260 --> 13:33.260
to know it

13:33.260 --> 13:34.240
as soon as you come?

13:34.260 --> 13:35.800
It's no longer a secret now.

13:35.820 --> 13:37.850
Drumsticks. Pork knuckle. You can take whatever

13:37.850 --> 13:39.320
-you want. -My Lady!

13:39.340 --> 13:40.440
What are you waiting for?

13:40.460 --> 13:41.700
Take him to the kitchen

13:41.700 --> 13:42.710
and get him prepared.

13:42.730 --> 13:43.920
Do it now!

13:48.580 --> 13:49.560
Lady Ye,

13:49.580 --> 13:50.460
what new idea

13:50.460 --> 13:51.960
do you have today?

13:52.820 --> 13:54.720
I went out of town yesterday
to watch sword shows on the street

13:54.780 --> 13:56.470
and learned that a chef

13:56.490 --> 13:57.700
can make dishes out of grains, vegetables, and beans

13:57.700 --> 13:59.680
with the taste of various meats

13:59.700 --> 14:00.680
which is not only tasty

14:00.700 --> 14:02.150
but also vivid.

14:02.170 --> 14:03.260
So I brought him here

14:03.260 --> 14:04.720
to satisfy your craving for food.

14:06.610 --> 14:08.200
You're so considerate.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.590
Of course!

14:09.610 --> 14:10.760
If you have a craving for any food

14:10.780 --> 14:12.710
in future,

14:12.730 --> 14:14.690
I'll bring him to you.

14:17.700 --> 14:20.130
I have no luck to enjoy them

14:20.170 --> 14:22.400
despite how honored I am.

14:25.170 --> 14:27.160
Are you alright?

14:27.970 --> 14:29.770
You are spitting blood again.

14:30.370 --> 14:31.660
Did you catch a cold yesterday

14:31.660 --> 14:32.920
when visiting the Qing Temple?

14:34.850 --> 14:36.130
I'm fine!

14:36.970 --> 14:38.600
Totally fine.

14:43.340 --> 14:44.570
Do you think

14:45.140 --> 14:47.160
some day

14:47.900 --> 14:49.960
I would get used to

14:50.140 --> 14:51.440
spitting blood.

14:51.460 --> 14:53.080
No way!

14:54.970 --> 14:56.890
Are you an assassin?

14:57.290 --> 14:58.510
Not really.

14:58.530 --> 15:00.510
Then, are you sent by the God?

15:00.530 --> 15:02.240
Not really either.

15:02.260 --> 15:03.770
I think you are.

15:06.020 --> 15:07.150
It's fine.

15:07.170 --> 15:09.480
After vomiting several times, I just get used to it.

15:15.730 --> 15:17.280
I'll find a famous reclused doctor for you

15:17.410 --> 15:18.970
some day when I go out of town.

15:18.970 --> 15:20.570
You'll be cured.

15:23.490 --> 15:25.080
In view of the current situation,

15:25.100 --> 15:26.590
I won't be happy

15:26.610 --> 15:28.280
even if I'm cured.

15:30.730 --> 15:32.330
You're still concerned about the bestowed marriage?

15:33.140 --> 15:34.020
I know the situation

15:34.020 --> 15:35.800
about my body.

15:35.820 --> 15:37.890
I could die any time.

15:38.100 --> 15:40.010
Why would I die with the marriage contract?

15:40.100 --> 15:41.480
That's bullshit!

15:43.020 --> 15:44.460
You don't have to blame yourself

15:44.460 --> 15:45.960
for a bastard.

15:47.290 --> 15:48.710
He is a bastard.

15:48.730 --> 15:50.270
So am I.

15:50.290 --> 15:51.720
What's the difference?

15:53.970 --> 15:55.800
You are the awe-inspiring princess

15:55.820 --> 15:57.480
which is evidently different from him.

16:02.610 --> 16:04.210
I grew up in sheer coverup

16:04.780 --> 16:06.570
for my whole life.

16:06.900 --> 16:10.280
The so-called identity as a princess is all fake.

16:11.340 --> 16:13.560
Even if I am a princess,

16:13.580 --> 16:15.880
I can barely decide

16:15.900 --> 16:18.520
who I can love.

16:19.820 --> 16:22.030
If anyone offends you,

16:22.050 --> 16:22.820
I can stand up for you

16:22.820 --> 16:24.960
to beat him up.

16:26.340 --> 16:27.810
But...

16:30.220 --> 16:33.280
I might have a weak body, but I have a strong will.

16:34.140 --> 16:35.770
My marriage

16:35.850 --> 16:37.840
shall not be controlled by the Emperor's order

16:37.930 --> 16:40.280
or by the usurp of the imperial power and treasure.

16:40.490 --> 16:41.960
I have only one requirement

16:42.370 --> 16:44.010
to the person that I'm going to marry.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.920
What's the requirement?

16:51.410 --> 16:53.450
It must be a person that I love.

16:54.490 --> 16:56.760
That's a good point, Wan'er.

16:56.780 --> 16:58.440
Yes. Love is the thing.

16:58.460 --> 16:59.290
I'm gonna fine a man

16:59.290 --> 17:00.810
that I love too.

17:03.490 --> 17:05.130
We're so indulged

17:05.620 --> 17:07.680
in empty talk.

17:08.890 --> 17:10.560
That's nothing difficult.

17:12.860 --> 17:15.130
Wait! Where are you going?

17:15.250 --> 17:16.720
Fan Xian is the determinant.

17:16.740 --> 17:17.530
I'm gonna find him

17:17.530 --> 17:18.560
and make it clear to him.

17:18.580 --> 17:19.340
He has to understand

17:19.340 --> 17:20.270
how bad he is

17:20.290 --> 17:21.630
and plead the emperor to cancel the marriage contract.

17:21.650 --> 17:22.480
My Lady,

17:22.500 --> 17:23.680
where are you going?

17:23.700 --> 17:24.890
You can't catch a cold again.

17:24.890 --> 17:26.750
We're going to ask for the
cancellation of the marriage contract.

17:26.770 --> 17:28.200
My Lady!

17:35.340 --> 17:36.560
Take some!

17:36.580 --> 17:38.930
No! No! No!

17:40.410 --> 17:41.720
By the way, I've got one more thing to do.

17:41.740 --> 17:43.270
Ask him to pull over!

17:43.290 --> 17:44.720
I need to get off.

17:45.250 --> 17:47.250
What's so urgent?

17:47.890 --> 17:50.200
I don't know either. I'm...

17:56.860 --> 17:58.050
Stop!

17:59.530 --> 18:00.650
Ask the guy from Danzhou

18:00.650 --> 18:01.840
to come off!

18:02.980 --> 18:04.290
Come off!

18:04.650 --> 18:05.630
I'm going off to take a look!

18:05.650 --> 18:06.750
It's OK.

18:06.770 --> 18:09.290
Don't worry. Sit tight!

18:11.530 --> 18:14.200
Do you hear me! Come off right now!

18:21.700 --> 18:22.890
Brother!

18:25.500 --> 18:26.840
It's all fine now.

18:29.170 --> 18:31.200
OK. Get off and take a look.

18:34.530 --> 18:36.720
He wanted a fight and got beaten up.

18:40.410 --> 18:41.600
Young Master!

18:41.620 --> 18:42.500
Young Master, please help me!

18:42.500 --> 18:43.750
Don't come to me! Go away!

18:43.770 --> 18:45.290
I don't even know you.

18:46.010 --> 18:47.250
Young Master!

18:47.250 --> 18:48.530
Shut up!

18:52.380 --> 18:54.030
Do you know them?

18:54.050 --> 18:56.250
No, do you?

18:56.290 --> 18:57.890
Me neither!

18:58.500 --> 18:59.930
Neither of us know him.

19:01.580 --> 19:02.290
Young Master!

19:02.290 --> 19:04.200
Shut up! I'm not your master!

19:04.700 --> 19:06.530
Total bullshit!

19:06.820 --> 19:08.370
I don't even know who you are.

19:08.530 --> 19:10.530
Why the heck do you take me as your master?

19:12.980 --> 19:15.840
The tie between me and my brother
is tighter than anything else.

19:17.890 --> 19:18.580
Don't you try

19:18.580 --> 19:20.290
to alienate us.

19:25.010 --> 19:26.290
Your Majesty,

19:26.740 --> 19:29.560
Fan Xian and the legitimate son of Earl Sinan were together.

19:29.580 --> 19:32.010
They should have gone to the Yishi House.

19:37.170 --> 19:38.630
And

19:38.650 --> 19:40.480
the men of the Crown Prince

19:40.500 --> 19:42.910
are keeping an eye on the whereabouts of Fan Xian.

19:42.930 --> 19:44.150
Apart from that,

19:44.170 --> 19:44.320
the hangers of the second prince

19:44.320 --> 19:45.580
the hangers of the second prince
=Eunuch Hou, private servant of Emperor Qing=

19:45.580 --> 19:46.920
are hunting him secretly.
=Eunuch Hou, private servant of Emperor Qing=

19:46.920 --> 19:47.320
are hunting him secretly.

19:47.340 --> 19:49.270
Fan Xian has no title.

19:49.290 --> 19:51.130
Shall we protect him?

19:51.380 --> 19:53.230
After all, he is taking over Neiku.

19:53.250 --> 19:56.440
and a talent nominated by you.

19:57.700 --> 20:00.130
How many fish are there in this pond?

20:02.340 --> 20:03.510
Eh...

20:03.530 --> 20:05.110
It's hard to tell with naked eyes.

20:05.130 --> 20:08.960
You can't tell as the water is too deep, right?

20:17.460 --> 20:18.510
How about now?

20:18.530 --> 20:20.680
The bait in your hands

20:20.890 --> 20:22.110
is Fan Xian.

20:22.130 --> 20:26.170
This pool of water is the capital city.

20:26.250 --> 20:27.270
And the fish...

20:27.290 --> 20:29.800
They are the common people.

20:36.860 --> 20:38.800
Thanks for coming, gentlemen!

20:43.410 --> 20:44.320
Find a place for the carriage first.

20:44.340 --> 20:45.220
We will wait for you upstairs.

20:45.220 --> 20:46.370
Sure!

20:48.530 --> 20:49.530
This Yishi House

20:49.530 --> 20:50.740
is a famous house in the capital city.

20:50.740 --> 20:52.080
It's very special.

20:52.100 --> 20:54.030
Since Sizhe will treat us,

20:54.050 --> 20:55.440
then this is it!

20:56.100 --> 20:57.440
Sister,

20:58.220 --> 20:59.980
isn't this a bit too expensive

20:59.980 --> 21:01.080
for me?

21:01.100 --> 21:02.230
You wanted to be the host yourself.

21:02.250 --> 21:03.800
No one forced you.

21:03.930 --> 21:04.930
Brother, let's get inside.

21:04.930 --> 21:06.530
Let's go and check out what to eat.

21:08.170 --> 21:09.530
Any books?

21:09.580 --> 21:10.270
What?

21:10.290 --> 21:11.510
Do you need any books?

21:11.530 --> 21:12.630
Forbidden books!

21:12.650 --> 21:13.860
This sounds so familiar.

21:13.860 --> 21:15.410
Do you also sell discs?

21:15.820 --> 21:16.870
What do you mean?

21:16.890 --> 21:18.320
I'm only selling books.

21:18.410 --> 21:19.930
Do you need any?

21:20.290 --> 21:21.680
I need to take a look first.

21:25.170 --> 21:26.320
Red Mansions!

21:26.340 --> 21:27.270
It really is!

21:27.290 --> 21:28.290
This book

21:28.290 --> 21:30.030
is a real masterpiece.

21:30.050 --> 21:31.150
It just got leaked on the streets.

21:31.170 --> 21:33.360
Eight taels of silver for a scroll. No bargaining.

21:33.380 --> 21:34.480
How much again?

21:34.500 --> 21:36.010
Eight taels of silver each scroll.

21:37.340 --> 21:38.600
Do you want it?

21:39.050 --> 21:40.870
What if I want a lot?

21:40.890 --> 21:42.930
You don't seem to carry many with you.

21:44.410 --> 21:46.200
If you really want,

21:46.220 --> 21:47.840
follow me to the rear alley.

21:48.620 --> 21:49.840
Wait for me upstairs.

21:49.860 --> 21:51.290
Are you serious?

21:51.580 --> 21:52.960
Please take the lead!

21:53.770 --> 21:55.050
Brother!

21:59.050 --> 22:00.680
Sister, look at him.

22:00.700 --> 22:02.770
How disgraceful!

22:03.010 --> 22:04.440
You can't understand it!

22:05.100 --> 22:06.840
That book is written by brother!

22:07.930 --> 22:09.800
By him?

22:10.050 --> 22:11.290
Please help yourselves!

22:11.410 --> 22:12.490
Please!

22:14.250 --> 22:14.990
Is everything ready?

22:15.010 --> 22:16.200
Yeah!

22:17.500 --> 22:18.220
Hurry up!

22:18.220 --> 22:20.080
The guests are waiting upstairs!

22:21.820 --> 22:23.600
Welcome inside!

22:30.980 --> 22:31.620
Let's go to another one!

22:31.620 --> 22:33.320
This way! Please come in!

22:36.100 --> 22:37.270
How far is it?

22:37.290 --> 22:37.890
Close!

22:37.890 --> 22:39.750
You must bargain by yourself when it comes.

22:39.770 --> 22:40.990
Not with you?

22:41.010 --> 22:42.030
You bargain directly with the boss

22:42.050 --> 22:43.480
since you buy a lot.

22:43.500 --> 22:45.600
The books belong to the boss.

22:46.460 --> 22:47.720
Right there.

22:47.770 --> 22:50.380
Remember! If the imperial officials come,

22:50.380 --> 22:51.050
you must leave without hesitation.

22:51.050 --> 22:51.930
So many people

22:51.930 --> 22:53.440
take books from him?

22:53.460 --> 22:55.720
Yeah! You gotta bargain on your own.

22:55.740 --> 22:57.480
I need to get back to the street.

22:57.500 --> 22:59.930
Do you need the book or not?

23:04.500 --> 23:05.680
Thank you!

23:05.700 --> 23:07.440
Can you give me one for free?

23:07.460 --> 23:08.750
Just one!

23:08.770 --> 23:10.770
Remember to run if you see the imperial officials.

23:10.930 --> 23:12.410
Go! Go!

23:12.770 --> 23:14.800
But don't run to me!

23:23.650 --> 23:25.480
Are all these books yours?

23:26.050 --> 23:27.840
How many do you want?

23:30.410 --> 23:31.250
Mr. Fan!

23:31.250 --> 23:32.870
Wang Qinian!

23:32.890 --> 23:34.860
First books, then maps!

23:34.860 --> 23:35.410
You are monopolizing

23:35.410 --> 23:37.030
the literature industry.

23:37.050 --> 23:39.870
What is literature industry?

23:39.890 --> 23:41.910
Shall we talk about the map first?

23:41.930 --> 23:43.230
Mr. Fan, how about...

23:43.250 --> 23:44.560
I'm willing to pay ten times as much

23:44.580 --> 23:46.290
for the map.

23:46.410 --> 23:47.320
That's delightful!

23:47.340 --> 23:48.630
I always have the courage

23:48.650 --> 23:51.080
to take the blame for what I did

23:51.580 --> 23:53.170
and behave myself neatly.

23:54.170 --> 23:55.840
Please look back.

23:59.820 --> 24:01.200
What's there to look?

24:05.220 --> 24:06.930
Run so fast!

24:17.100 --> 24:18.680
I don't know when the Young Master

24:18.700 --> 24:20.080
will come back either.

24:20.820 --> 24:22.050
OK.

24:25.460 --> 24:27.770
My Lady, I checked.

24:30.130 --> 24:31.600
Fan Xian is not home.

24:33.220 --> 24:34.390
Where did he go?

24:34.410 --> 24:36.150
It seems he went to the house.

24:36.170 --> 24:38.200
What a merrymaker!

24:44.820 --> 24:46.200
Are you alright?

24:49.930 --> 24:51.320
It shall be fine

24:51.580 --> 24:52.130
to put forward the cancellation of marriage contract

24:52.130 --> 24:53.960
in front of Mrs. Liu in the residence.

24:55.820 --> 24:57.800
His Majesty finalized my marriage

24:57.820 --> 24:59.630
without my consent.

24:59.650 --> 25:01.530
I'm not happy with it.

25:01.890 --> 25:04.800
Don't do to others what you don't want yourself.

25:05.860 --> 25:07.650
Even if I want it to be cancelled,

25:07.700 --> 25:09.560
I should look him in the eyes

25:09.580 --> 25:11.170
and tell him.

25:15.220 --> 25:16.960
I surely will help you.

25:17.220 --> 25:19.290
I'm so weak physically

25:19.340 --> 25:21.440
and yet so stubborn.

25:23.860 --> 25:25.320
Thank you for helping me.

25:28.580 --> 25:29.800
How stupid you are!

25:37.340 --> 25:38.840
Guess who is the book trafficker?

25:38.860 --> 25:39.340
Who is it?

25:39.340 --> 25:40.720
Wang Qinian!

25:40.820 --> 25:41.560
Where is he?

25:41.580 --> 25:43.510
He ran away in a flash!

25:43.530 --> 25:45.410
This book is widely spread

25:45.410 --> 25:46.560
among the girls of each household.

25:46.580 --> 25:48.600
We don't know how it got leaked.

25:48.980 --> 25:50.800
Brother, it's all my fault.

25:50.820 --> 25:51.720
That's alright!

25:51.740 --> 25:54.480
Books are meant to be read by people.

25:58.290 --> 25:59.650
What are you looking at?

26:00.460 --> 26:02.250
So many book dealers!

26:03.130 --> 26:04.050
Take a look!

26:04.050 --> 26:04.740
It's the same!

26:04.740 --> 26:05.510
Please take a look!

26:05.530 --> 26:06.200
Sure!

26:06.220 --> 26:07.800
This is the most popular book

26:07.820 --> 26:08.960
on the street now.

26:08.980 --> 26:10.230
Do you need one?

26:10.250 --> 26:10.930
Why do so many people

26:10.930 --> 26:12.130
carry babies?

26:12.170 --> 26:13.800
Wang Qinian is remarkable.

26:13.820 --> 26:15.170
He is the friend of women.

26:15.770 --> 26:16.960
Fan Xian,

26:16.980 --> 26:18.870
did you really write this book?

26:18.890 --> 26:20.600
No!

26:20.620 --> 26:22.890
It is the Red Mansions of Cao Xueqin.

26:23.220 --> 26:25.440
Brother, don't hold it back.

26:25.460 --> 26:26.680
There is no such person in the world.

26:26.700 --> 26:27.930
It is really not me.

26:27.930 --> 26:28.650
This book is a masterpiece.

26:28.650 --> 26:29.700
How can I steal the honor of it

26:29.700 --> 26:30.800
by claiming to be the writer?

26:30.820 --> 26:31.720
What I did

26:31.740 --> 26:33.030
is only to write it from memory.

26:33.050 --> 26:33.910
In a word,

26:33.930 --> 26:35.100
are you the only one

26:35.100 --> 26:36.910
who knows the story thereafter?

26:36.930 --> 26:37.680
Why do you ask?

26:37.700 --> 26:39.990
Fan Xian, we can take over

26:40.010 --> 26:41.680
the book trafficking business.

26:42.220 --> 26:43.650
Fan Sizhe,

26:43.700 --> 26:44.910
stop messing around!

26:44.930 --> 26:46.440
No, sister!

26:46.980 --> 26:48.560
I observed very carefully just now.

26:48.580 --> 26:50.200
A lot of people buy this book.

26:50.220 --> 26:52.560
Eight taels of silver for one scroll.

26:53.340 --> 26:54.770
Look at this book!

26:54.930 --> 26:56.600
It has mediocre quality.

26:56.620 --> 26:57.750
The cost is no more than three qian and two fen

26:57.770 --> 26:59.440
for platemaking and printing,

26:59.460 --> 27:00.440
excluding manpower.

27:00.460 --> 27:01.770
So we can make a profit of

27:01.770 --> 27:02.860
seven taels six qian and eight fen

27:02.860 --> 27:04.320
with the sales of each book.

27:04.340 --> 27:05.620
About eight to nine books were sold

27:05.620 --> 27:06.720
in such a short while.

27:06.740 --> 27:07.680
If we spread the network,

27:07.700 --> 27:09.390
hundreds of them can be sold in a day.

27:09.410 --> 27:10.130
With the sales

27:10.130 --> 27:11.030
of a hundred books,

27:11.050 --> 27:11.740
we can make

27:11.740 --> 27:13.200
768 taels of silver.

27:13.220 --> 27:14.150
If we hold a good control of time

27:14.170 --> 27:15.340
and publish one scroll for every 15 days,

27:15.340 --> 27:15.820
that will be

27:15.820 --> 27:17.620
11,520 taels of silver.

27:17.620 --> 27:18.770
If we take out the cost for manpower and network

27:18.770 --> 27:19.800
which should be enough for three fen,

27:19.820 --> 27:20.530
we can still make

27:20.530 --> 27:21.460
8,064 taels of silver

27:21.460 --> 27:22.130
as pure profit.

27:22.130 --> 27:23.530
If you publish 12 scrolls,

27:23.530 --> 27:24.010
it will be

27:24.010 --> 27:25.530
96,768 taels of silver.

27:25.530 --> 27:27.270
This is just a rough estimation.

27:27.290 --> 27:29.080
It's so lucrative, Fan Xian!

27:29.170 --> 27:30.680
What do you call him?

27:31.170 --> 27:32.720
Brother! My most beloved brother!

27:32.740 --> 27:33.890
As long as you give me this business,

27:33.890 --> 27:34.770
I can call you uncle

27:34.770 --> 27:36.370
if you want me to,

27:36.620 --> 27:38.030
let alone brother.

27:38.050 --> 27:38.620
What do you think?

27:38.620 --> 27:39.410
Let's do this together.

27:39.410 --> 27:40.630
You publish the book. I will take care of the network of shops.

27:40.650 --> 27:41.380
And then we split the profit 40/60.

27:41.380 --> 27:42.410
You get 60 and I get 40.

27:42.410 --> 27:43.740
You can get

27:43.740 --> 27:45.170
4,838.4 taels of silver

27:45.170 --> 27:46.770
for every 15 days.

27:46.770 --> 27:48.080
What do you think?

27:48.100 --> 27:50.170
How did you get all these numbers?

27:52.460 --> 27:54.010
Do I even need to calculate?

27:54.410 --> 27:56.080
It's so simple.

27:57.340 --> 27:58.150
Get out of the way!

27:58.170 --> 27:58.960
Get out of the way, all of you!

27:58.980 --> 28:00.320
Stop selling!

28:00.380 --> 28:01.560
Get out of the way!

28:02.620 --> 28:04.080
Who allows you to sell this? Go away!

28:04.100 --> 28:05.440
This is forbidden now. Get out of the way!

28:05.460 --> 28:06.800
What's going on here?

28:06.820 --> 28:08.170
Who allows you to sell it?

28:08.290 --> 28:09.440
Go away!

28:15.740 --> 28:18.050
Sir, they are all gone now!

28:21.080 --> 28:23.150
=Guo Baokun,
son of Nanqing Minister of the Board of Rites Guo Youzhi=

28:30.650 --> 28:31.750
Damn!

28:31.770 --> 28:32.960
What happened?

28:33.460 --> 28:35.170
This guy is Guo Baokun,

28:35.580 --> 28:37.150
the son of the Minister of the Board of Rites.

28:37.170 --> 28:38.560
What is he doing?

28:38.620 --> 28:41.080
It was he who persecuted your family?

28:41.100 --> 28:41.770
Yes!

28:41.770 --> 28:43.560
Don't you want to beat him up?

28:43.580 --> 28:45.110
I've got only one life now.

28:45.130 --> 28:46.840
I can't run the risk.

28:46.890 --> 28:48.080
Folks,

28:48.860 --> 28:51.440
I am Guo Baokun!

28:51.620 --> 28:54.650
My father is the Minister of the Board of Rites.

28:54.700 --> 28:56.200
I am too humble to be blessed

28:56.580 --> 28:58.960
with the position of an editor in the palace.

28:58.980 --> 29:01.410
I attended school ever since I was young.

29:01.460 --> 29:03.080
I know rites.

29:03.100 --> 29:04.720
As you are all intellectuals,

29:04.740 --> 29:07.290
you should read the sages and men of virtues.

29:08.010 --> 29:10.560
It's such a shame to read filthy book

29:11.010 --> 29:12.930
like this.

29:15.290 --> 29:18.800
In my opinion,

29:20.010 --> 29:21.650
this book should be banned from today onwards.

29:23.700 --> 29:24.910
That's bullshit!

29:24.930 --> 29:26.440
Guo Baokun, you're talking non-sense.

29:26.460 --> 29:28.050
Who is talking to me like this?

29:28.050 --> 29:29.800
Your grandpa!

29:34.410 --> 29:36.890
Who is Guo Baokun close to?

29:37.770 --> 29:39.320
He used to be the reading partner for Eastern Palace.

29:39.340 --> 29:40.720
We can take him as on the Crown Prince's side.

29:40.740 --> 29:42.650
It's the Crown Prince again!

29:43.340 --> 29:44.800
He's involved again!

29:45.100 --> 29:45.980
He has been looking towards me

29:45.980 --> 29:47.390
while he was talking just now.

29:47.410 --> 29:48.930
He knows that I am here.

29:49.010 --> 29:50.440
Now that he is against you,

29:50.460 --> 29:52.130
why would he become so agitated?

29:52.530 --> 29:53.870
That's right!

29:53.890 --> 29:55.630
Fan Sizhe and Guo Baokun are enemies?

29:55.650 --> 29:56.840
I haven't heard of that before.

29:56.860 --> 29:59.410
Hey! Stop messing around!

30:03.650 --> 30:06.630
This book is so popular.

30:06.650 --> 30:07.620
It means

30:07.620 --> 30:08.990
it's a good book.

30:09.010 --> 30:10.750
You want to ban a good book.

30:10.770 --> 30:12.230
What's your title?

30:12.250 --> 30:13.390
Editor in the palace.

30:13.410 --> 30:14.630
That's a small enough title

30:14.650 --> 30:16.930
to even step into the imperial office.

30:17.130 --> 30:19.560
I know who the heck you are.

30:19.580 --> 30:20.980
What a dumbass!

30:20.980 --> 30:21.990
You are the dumbass!

30:22.010 --> 30:22.980
Your dad is the Minister of dumbasses!

30:22.980 --> 30:24.480
-Mr. Guo, please calm down! -How dare you!

30:25.960 --> 30:27.230
=He Zongwei, a scholar in the capital city of Nanqing=

30:27.250 --> 30:30.630
I've heard you are outstanding in terms of eloquence

30:30.650 --> 30:32.320
and family knowledge.

30:32.500 --> 30:33.720
I didn't believe it at the start.

30:33.740 --> 30:35.220
Now I see you

30:35.220 --> 30:36.960
defend the honor for scholars

30:36.980 --> 30:38.680
in the world.

30:38.770 --> 30:42.150
It's so admirable!

30:42.170 --> 30:44.370
He Zongwei is well-known as a scholar

30:44.580 --> 30:46.270
in the capital city.

30:46.290 --> 30:48.840
It looks like he has found a wise master.

30:49.130 --> 30:51.230
I've known you well

30:51.250 --> 30:53.010
by your reputation as a talent.

30:53.980 --> 30:56.720
I feel flattered

30:56.980 --> 30:57.870
and regretful to it.

30:57.890 --> 30:59.630
That's all bullshit.

30:59.650 --> 31:01.050
Be careful with your words.

31:01.650 --> 31:03.750
This guy is the son of Earl Sinan.

31:03.770 --> 31:05.250
Earl Sinan is in charge of the Ministry of the Revenue

31:05.250 --> 31:07.030
which has all the silvers.

31:07.050 --> 31:09.960
So definitely his son will be superficial.

31:09.980 --> 31:11.080
How dare you insult my dad!

31:11.100 --> 31:12.180
I...

31:13.770 --> 31:14.680
It's fine.

31:14.700 --> 31:15.870
Guo Baokun won't recognize me.

31:15.890 --> 31:17.150
But his subordinates may recognize you.

31:17.170 --> 31:18.440
Don't reveal yourself.

31:19.700 --> 31:20.680
What do we do then

31:20.700 --> 31:22.320
other than watching him bullied?

31:22.460 --> 31:24.010
Let me go!

31:24.820 --> 31:26.600
After all, I'm your dad's colleague in the palace.

31:26.820 --> 31:28.360
Kowtow to me for forgiveness,

31:28.380 --> 31:29.750
and I'll forgive you this time

31:29.770 --> 31:30.510
for the sake of your dad.

31:30.530 --> 31:32.680
I won't apologize to a pig!

31:32.700 --> 31:34.250
Throw this dumbass harder!

31:53.130 --> 31:55.440
So here comes the bastard

31:55.460 --> 31:58.650
that Earl Sinan raised in Danzhou.

32:03.380 --> 32:04.800
Hi, Lady Ruoruo!

32:06.010 --> 32:08.530
What a talent you are!

32:08.740 --> 32:09.890
But it's such a pity

32:09.890 --> 32:11.560
that you have these rubbish

32:11.770 --> 32:13.530
as brothers.

32:16.860 --> 32:17.960
I'm afraid you made a mistake.

32:17.980 --> 32:19.410
I'm just a passer-by.

32:20.010 --> 32:21.290
What?

32:22.220 --> 32:24.200
Do you feel ashamed?

32:24.220 --> 32:24.860
Fan Xian!

32:24.860 --> 32:25.770
How come you're afraid

32:25.770 --> 32:27.250
to admit your own identity?

32:27.740 --> 32:28.820
I really don't expect you

32:28.820 --> 32:30.600
to admire me so much!

32:30.820 --> 32:32.200
That's bullshit!

32:32.500 --> 32:33.390
Of course no!

32:33.410 --> 32:34.480
I just came here from the capital city yesterday.

32:34.500 --> 32:35.600
Today is my first day out.

32:35.620 --> 32:37.410
I barely recognize all my family

32:37.410 --> 32:38.890
before you recognize me with one blink of an eye.

32:38.890 --> 32:40.390
You even memorize my name so clearly.

32:40.410 --> 32:42.770
Is it because you admire me for long?

32:42.980 --> 32:44.360
You...

32:44.380 --> 32:45.680
You may keep silent if you can't think of any words to say.

32:45.700 --> 32:46.720
It looks embarrassing to me.

32:46.740 --> 32:47.870
Let's get back to where we were.

32:47.890 --> 32:49.680
If I hadn't come down to help,

32:49.890 --> 32:51.600
one of his arms would have been broken by now.

32:51.620 --> 32:54.200
Yeah, so what?

32:56.700 --> 32:58.110
What are you waiting for?

32:58.130 --> 32:59.440
Come on!

33:00.100 --> 33:02.360
He is nothing but a bastard.

33:02.380 --> 33:03.720
Nothing to be afraid!

33:05.100 --> 33:06.930
You wanted to break his arm.

33:07.930 --> 33:09.750
I'd break your nose in return.

33:09.770 --> 33:11.130
That's a fair treatment.

33:12.170 --> 33:14.080
Countryside rubbish!

33:14.100 --> 33:16.130
Arrogant and overweening.

33:16.890 --> 33:18.230
Why do you look at me?

33:18.250 --> 33:19.110
Just do it!

33:19.130 --> 33:20.560
You have me at your back.

33:26.010 --> 33:28.250
Overbearing Vitality Qi.

33:42.170 --> 33:43.530
Well done!

33:56.170 --> 33:57.100
What do you want to do?

33:57.100 --> 33:58.600
Beat him up!

33:59.890 --> 34:01.050
Did you just say

34:01.050 --> 34:02.370
this is filthy book?

34:02.890 --> 34:04.110
Yes, I did. So what?

34:04.130 --> 34:05.390
Have you read it?

34:05.410 --> 34:07.150
I don't even have enough time to read books from the sages.

34:07.170 --> 34:09.130
How can I have time to read this stuff?

34:10.580 --> 34:12.280
How about you?

34:13.180 --> 34:15.210
I was too afraid it will stain my eyes.

34:15.690 --> 34:17.320
An insult

34:17.340 --> 34:18.840
based on nothing.

34:19.050 --> 34:20.950
The writer of this book is obscure.

34:20.970 --> 34:21.970
What good word could he produce?

34:21.970 --> 34:22.820
Do you read his book

34:22.820 --> 34:24.280
or his fame?

34:24.380 --> 34:25.100
If a writer is not famous,

34:25.100 --> 34:26.710
can't he produce any good works?

34:26.730 --> 34:27.860
Without learning, one cannot increase his knowledge.

34:27.860 --> 34:28.990
Without indomitable will, one cannot finish his studies.

34:29.010 --> 34:30.050
You're too short-sighted

34:30.050 --> 34:31.800
to claim yourselves scholars

34:32.100 --> 34:33.650
or literary figures.

34:33.860 --> 34:35.290
You don't even have the cultivation

34:35.290 --> 34:36.180
to treat others' works with respect.

34:36.180 --> 34:37.710
Shame on you!

34:37.730 --> 34:38.750
Damn you!

34:38.770 --> 34:40.180
No countryside men like you

34:40.180 --> 34:41.490
can comment on scholars

34:41.490 --> 34:42.560
like us.

34:42.580 --> 34:43.580
Put your tongue straight

34:43.580 --> 34:44.560
before talking.

34:44.580 --> 34:45.730
If all scholars in this world

34:45.730 --> 34:46.530
are like you,

34:46.530 --> 34:48.430
I'll feel ashamed to be one of it.

34:48.450 --> 34:49.690
Well said!

34:50.420 --> 34:53.040
Mr. Fan's words are classic.

34:55.420 --> 34:56.760
Your Highness!

34:59.050 --> 34:59.990
Your Highness!

35:00.010 --> 35:02.520
Without learning, one cannot increase his knowledge.

35:02.580 --> 35:05.030
Without indomitable will, one cannot finish his studies.

35:05.050 --> 35:07.430
I thought about these two sentences.

35:07.450 --> 35:08.920
There is a lot of meaning behind it.

35:08.940 --> 35:10.660
It's one glimpse

35:10.660 --> 35:12.800
of Mr. Fan's knowledge.

35:12.820 --> 35:14.160
Your Highness,

35:14.180 --> 35:14.770
don't get cheated

35:14.770 --> 35:16.450
by this guy.

35:16.820 --> 35:18.100
You two have always been famous

35:18.100 --> 35:19.160
as talents.

35:19.180 --> 35:20.100
Coincidentally,

35:20.100 --> 35:22.080
there will be a poetry gathering at my residence.

35:22.100 --> 35:23.380
You should come for the sake of making friends

35:23.380 --> 35:24.640
through literature and cultivating yourselves through poems.

35:24.660 --> 35:26.800
You can compete through poem on the poetry gathering

35:26.820 --> 35:29.010
so that all the intellectuals in the world can see

35:29.010 --> 35:31.320
who is the actual scholar.

35:31.320 --> 35:31.420
who is the actual scholar.
=Li Hongcheng, Nanqing Prince Jing's son=

35:31.420 --> 35:32.140
What do you think?
=Li Hongcheng, Nanqing Prince Jing's son=

35:32.140 --> 35:33.220
=Li Hongcheng, Nanqing Prince Jing's son=

35:35.250 --> 35:36.600
I'll come for sure!

35:36.620 --> 35:37.840
So will I.

35:40.490 --> 35:41.760
Who are you?

35:43.770 --> 35:45.900
This is Li Hongcheng,

35:45.900 --> 35:47.230
Prince Jing's son.

35:47.250 --> 35:48.140
Who is Prince Jing?

35:48.140 --> 35:49.600
Don't say it out loud.

35:49.620 --> 35:51.380
Prince Jing is the biological brother

35:51.380 --> 35:52.750
of His Majesty.

35:52.770 --> 35:54.320
Royal bloodline!

35:56.660 --> 35:58.560
Scholarship is the origin of mankind.

35:58.580 --> 36:00.320
Bloodline is not worth mentioning.

36:05.450 --> 36:06.890
You've got a good attitude.

36:08.290 --> 36:09.190
By the way,

36:09.210 --> 36:10.690
will there be any girls on the poetry gathering?

36:10.900 --> 36:12.820
There will be a lot of female scholars indeed.

36:12.820 --> 36:13.600
Good job!

36:13.620 --> 36:14.420
You pick up girl scholars

36:14.420 --> 36:15.840
with sobriety.

36:16.770 --> 36:19.130
What does "pick up" mean?

36:20.050 --> 36:21.080
Then it's a deal.

36:21.100 --> 36:22.520
See you tomorrow at the poetry gathering.

36:22.620 --> 36:24.600
Sure! Will wait you for it.

36:46.820 --> 36:48.670
Li Hongcheng, Prince Jing's son,

36:48.690 --> 36:49.990
has a reputation among the masses.

36:50.010 --> 36:52.410
He likes literature and poetry gathering.

36:53.050 --> 36:56.000
Scholars from different schools join it.

36:56.050 --> 36:57.950
I didn't expect you to join it

36:57.970 --> 36:59.730
as I thought you may not like it.

36:59.730 --> 37:01.080
We can't escape it.

37:01.770 --> 37:02.710
What do you mean?

37:02.730 --> 37:04.210
It's nothing but a meal.

37:04.450 --> 37:06.080
Disciples of the prince and Prince Jing's son

37:06.100 --> 37:07.650
showed up one after another.

37:08.340 --> 37:09.620
And a newly arrived bastard

37:09.620 --> 37:10.180
got invited

37:10.180 --> 37:11.660
to the poetry gathering

37:11.660 --> 37:13.040
just because of a few words.

37:13.140 --> 37:14.950
Isn't it a bit hasty?

37:14.970 --> 37:16.640
You don't think it's a coincidence?

37:16.660 --> 37:18.760
He is there to wait for me.

37:19.730 --> 37:22.130
Don't think too much.

37:22.180 --> 37:24.320
He is Prince Jing's son.

37:24.340 --> 37:26.000
Why would he wait for you?

37:26.140 --> 37:27.320
Besides,

37:27.340 --> 37:28.730
who could predict that

37:28.730 --> 37:30.360
you're going to Yishi House today?

37:30.380 --> 37:31.290
It's very easy to find the destination

37:31.290 --> 37:33.040
by following the carriage.

37:34.010 --> 37:35.450
So he sent someone

37:35.450 --> 37:37.120
to wait for you at the gate of our home

37:37.140 --> 37:38.750
just to meet you

37:38.770 --> 37:39.880
and invite you to the poetry gathering?

37:39.900 --> 37:42.180
Is it even possible? Don't think too much.

37:42.180 --> 37:43.490
More or less.

37:44.420 --> 37:46.030
So what about Guo Baokun?

37:46.050 --> 37:48.370
Guo Baokun was sent by the Crown Prince.

37:49.010 --> 37:50.800
So you mean the prince wants to meet you

37:50.820 --> 37:52.600
and Prince Jing's son wants to meet you too.

37:52.620 --> 37:53.620
I didn't notice

37:53.620 --> 37:54.580
you're such a hot potato.

37:54.580 --> 37:56.240
You have to ask them about this.

37:56.940 --> 37:58.800
Stop woolgathering!

38:09.970 --> 38:12.970
This book is very popular recently.

38:13.210 --> 38:16.760
Unprecedented masterpiece.

38:17.730 --> 38:19.120
Fan Xian

38:19.140 --> 38:21.230
is a bit straightforward.

38:21.250 --> 38:24.490
He is a funny man and extraordinary.

38:25.420 --> 38:26.290
Not many people in the capital city

38:26.290 --> 38:27.690
get praise like this

38:27.690 --> 38:28.950
from you.

38:28.970 --> 38:31.760
How about a meeting with him tomorrow?

38:34.250 --> 38:35.800
No, let's wait a bit more

38:38.730 --> 38:40.240
and see how it goes.

38:40.660 --> 38:41.930
Alright!

38:55.660 --> 38:56.750
What are you doing?

38:56.770 --> 38:57.580
Why did you dash downstairs

38:57.580 --> 38:59.000
just now?

38:59.690 --> 39:00.380
Didn't you notice

39:00.380 --> 39:01.710
he insulted your book?

39:01.730 --> 39:03.710
Why would you care about it while I didn't?

39:03.730 --> 39:05.690
We are going to sell the book together

39:05.690 --> 39:07.190
but he tried to ban it.

39:07.210 --> 39:08.050
Cutting off my road to wealth

39:08.050 --> 39:09.880
is no worse than killing my parents.

39:09.900 --> 39:12.240
Who promised to work with you?

39:13.100 --> 39:16.170
Don't you think about it? It's lucrative!

39:16.450 --> 39:18.560
You're really quick at calculating.

39:18.580 --> 39:19.510
Just so so.

39:19.530 --> 39:21.430
That doesn't matter.

39:21.450 --> 39:22.640
Think about it carefully.

39:22.660 --> 39:24.600
Shall we work together?

39:25.290 --> 39:26.510
Why do you want to sell books?

39:26.530 --> 39:27.380
To make money,

39:27.380 --> 39:28.400
of course.

39:28.420 --> 39:30.240
Why do you want to make money?

39:31.140 --> 39:32.950
What do you mean?

39:32.970 --> 39:34.210
Do you plan to buy something expensive

39:34.210 --> 39:35.230
with the money you make

39:35.250 --> 39:37.520
or to go to the casino or the brothel?

39:37.770 --> 39:38.950
I haven't thought about those.

39:38.970 --> 39:40.560
I just enjoy making money.

39:43.530 --> 39:45.600
Don't look at me like that.

39:45.620 --> 39:47.650
Do you agree?

39:49.660 --> 39:51.560
You must do me a favor.

39:51.900 --> 39:53.410
What is it?

40:06.290 --> 40:07.800
No one is here. You could get off.

40:07.820 --> 40:09.160
What's going on?

40:09.180 --> 40:11.190
Take the carriage back to the residence directly

40:11.210 --> 40:12.140
and don't let anyone know

40:12.140 --> 40:13.410
I have left.

40:14.940 --> 40:16.410
Where are you going?

40:16.820 --> 40:19.130
Stop asking, or I'll not let you sell my book.

40:19.380 --> 40:21.270
It's pointless to threaten me.

40:21.290 --> 40:22.620
My sister is here.

40:22.620 --> 40:24.400
She is most afraid to lie.

40:24.420 --> 40:25.420
She can't help you for sure.

40:25.420 --> 40:26.600
Am I right, sister?

40:26.900 --> 40:27.840
Just go, brother!

40:27.860 --> 40:29.400
Don't worry. I'll watch over him

40:29.420 --> 40:30.840
and stop him from leaking.

40:31.690 --> 40:32.770
Eh...

40:36.660 --> 40:38.080
Don't leak!

40:38.580 --> 40:40.430
The way you treat me

40:40.450 --> 40:41.050
is totally different from the way

40:41.050 --> 40:42.650
you treat him.

40:46.580 --> 40:47.880
Turn left at the entrance of the alley

40:47.900 --> 40:49.730
and go east all the way to Tianhe street.

40:49.730 --> 40:51.520
You'll find the Investigator's Office.

40:52.730 --> 40:54.080
Send them back to the residence.

40:54.100 --> 40:55.640
I can find it on my own.

40:55.660 --> 40:57.120
You're the Director-General of the Investigator's Office.

40:57.140 --> 40:58.800
Do you still need to sneak in?

40:58.820 --> 40:59.690
Don't let anyone know

40:59.690 --> 41:01.240
my identity as the Director-General.

41:01.580 --> 41:02.820
The files of your family whereabouts

41:02.820 --> 41:03.900
is D No. 534,

41:03.900 --> 41:04.560
right?

41:04.580 --> 41:05.510
Yes!

41:05.530 --> 41:06.140
Wait for my good news.

41:06.140 --> 41:07.320
Thanks!

41:13.580 --> 41:14.450
Think about where to open

41:14.450 --> 41:15.920
the book shop.

41:15.940 --> 41:17.210
We'll discuss it when I come back.

41:17.900 --> 41:19.210
So you agree with it?

41:19.730 --> 41:21.240
Don't let anyone see you.

41:24.290 --> 41:25.600
Hooray!

41:40.250 --> 41:42.320
Hawthorn on sticks!

41:42.690 --> 41:45.650
Hawthorn on sticks!

41:48.140 --> 41:50.320
Hawthorn on sticks!

41:50.340 --> 41:52.880
Hawthorn on sticks!

41:52.900 --> 41:54.730
Hawthorn on sticks!

41:56.010 --> 41:57.730
Sure, sir!

41:57.860 --> 42:00.120
Hawthorn on sticks!

42:00.140 --> 42:03.360
Hawthorn on sticks!

42:03.380 --> 42:05.640
Gotta pick the store for printing.

42:05.660 --> 42:07.510
And the paper as well.

42:07.530 --> 42:08.670
All the illegal books

42:08.690 --> 42:09.820
out there

42:09.820 --> 42:10.770
must be collected,

42:10.770 --> 42:12.230
or they will have a bad impact on my sales.

42:12.250 --> 42:13.010
All these must be taken into consideration

42:13.010 --> 42:14.560
and get prepared.

42:17.580 --> 42:19.040
Did we reach already?

42:19.420 --> 42:20.690
We are stuck.

42:26.210 --> 42:27.750
Let's retreat and make way for them.

42:27.770 --> 42:28.930
Sure!

42:30.860 --> 42:33.690
Miss Fan, hold on a second!

42:37.770 --> 42:38.560
Who is it?

42:38.580 --> 42:39.490
The girl from the Ye family

42:39.490 --> 42:40.690
who likes messing around from day to night.

42:40.770 --> 42:42.170
I remember her now.

42:42.210 --> 42:43.620
Is it the girl

42:43.620 --> 42:44.580
who gave you two cases of diamonds and jewelries

42:44.580 --> 42:45.600
every Spring Festival?

42:45.620 --> 42:46.800
No, not she!

42:46.970 --> 42:47.940
It's Ye Ling'er,

42:47.940 --> 42:49.750
the daughter of Chief Guard of the capital city.

42:49.770 --> 42:51.690
Just send her away!

42:51.770 --> 42:53.690
Ye Ling'er is not a big deal.

42:53.860 --> 42:56.470
I feel like she has other companies.

42:56.490 --> 42:57.750
Who else did you see?

42:57.770 --> 42:59.410
It's the carriage from the Fan mansion.

43:24.120 --> 43:27.700
In the river of history,

43:27.720 --> 43:31.190
time goes round and round.

43:34.000 --> 43:37.340
Memories about the former and present lives

43:37.360 --> 43:41.430
join each other in an endless way.

43:43.320 --> 43:45.940
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:45.960 --> 43:48.200
one season follows another in a flash,

43:48.200 --> 43:50.700
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:50.720 --> 43:52.320
I just can't give up

43:52.320 --> 43:55.660
to be with you for my whole life.

43:55.680 --> 44:01.150
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:02.400 --> 44:04.950
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:05.240 --> 44:07.280
Year after year in the wandering,

44:07.280 --> 44:09.940
I count the remaining years.

44:09.960 --> 44:12.140
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:12.160 --> 44:14.150
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:14.440 --> 44:16.830
I never feel regretful.

44:16.880 --> 44:18.240
In such a chaotic world,

44:18.240 --> 44:21.220
I still miss you as ever.

44:21.240 --> 44:24.190
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:24.480 --> 44:26.540
With a gentle heart,

44:26.560 --> 44:29.220
I cherish our remaining years.

44:29.240 --> 44:30.760
Even though we have to go through

44:30.760 --> 44:33.270
all the hardships along the journey,

44:33.400 --> 44:40.590
you always stay by my side,

44:40.680 --> 44:43.350
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:43.640 --> 44:45.720
Year after year in the wandering,

44:45.720 --> 44:48.380
I count the remaining years.

44:48.400 --> 44:50.540
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:50.560 --> 44:52.790
even though we end up the destiny,

44:53.000 --> 44:55.180
I never feel regretful.

44:55.200 --> 44:56.600
In such a chaotic world,

44:56.600 --> 44:59.660
I still miss you as ever.

44:59.680 --> 45:02.790
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:02.880 --> 45:05.020
With a gentle heart,

45:05.040 --> 45:07.740
I cherish our remaining years.

45:07.760 --> 45:09.200
Even though we have to go through

45:09.200 --> 45:11.860
all the hardships along the journey,

45:11.880 --> 45:20.640
you always stay by my side...
